  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ajuri (seeds) of good living</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to the strengthening of CIR&#x2019;s institutional governance bodies and its increased administrative and financial capacity. The project will also promote sustainable management of indigenous lands in the state of Roraima, driven by the leadership of indigenous communities, contributing to enhanced governance over their lands and the promotion of indigenous peoples&apos; rights. By promoting sustainable management of indigenous lands in the state of Roraima, the project contributes to climate change mitigation. One of the deliveries of the agreement is the consolidation of the &#x201C;Rut&#xEE; Fund&#x201D;, through which local indigenous projects &#x2013; with special attention to projects by and for indigenous women &#x2013; will be financed.</narrative>
  </description>
